    "q-104241": {
      "dom_id": "step-q104241",
      "name": "Question 14",
      "problem": "What surface is defined by the equation $z=\\frac{1}{5}r$ in cylindrical polar coordinates?",
      "worked_solution": "The position of a point in cylindrical polar coordinates is written as $(r,\\theta ,z),$ where \n\n- $r\\ge 0$ and $\\theta \\in [0,2\\pi )$ are the usual plane polar coordinates, and\n\n- $z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )$ is the usual Cartesian $z$-coordinate.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our equation:\n\n$$\nz=\\frac{1}{5}r\n$$\n\nThis equation requires that the distance from any point on the surface to the $xy$-plane equals one-fifth the distance from that point to the $z$-axis. In other words, the tangent of the angle between any position vector on the surface and the $z$-axis must be equal to\n\n$$\n\\frac{r}{z}=\\frac{r}{(\\frac{1}{5}r)}=5.\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, $\\theta $ can vary arbitrarily in its domain. \n\nTherefore, our surface is the half-cone shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14220175/assets/69978d3f1026cf83019924c44d66f0e510ce8c84b35d10c77c270b87809b30aa.png)",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-104241-a",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A half-cone",
              "html": "A half-cone"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-104241-b",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A half-plane that passes through the $z$-axis",
              "html": "A half-plane that passes through the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"229\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-axis"
            },
            {
              "option": "c",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-104241-c",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A circular cylinder",
              "html": "A circular cylinder"
            },
            {
              "option": "d",
